---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Vyxqor" description="How Vyxqor handles your data. We collect the minimum necessary and never sell personal information.">
<div class="container" style="padding: 48px 0 80px; max-width: 720px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-2);">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Our Approach</h2>
      <p>Vyxqor is designed with privacy in mind. We do not require user registration to browse, search, or compare AI tools. We collect only the minimum data necessary to operate the website and improve our content.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">2. What We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you visit Vyxqor, we may collect:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li><strong>Analytics data:</strong> Page views, referral sources, and approximate location (country/city level) via Google Analytics 4. IP addresses are anonymized.</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate click data:</strong> Which tool links you click, for the purpose of tracking commissions. This does not include personal identifiers.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> Browser type, device type, and operating system for performance optimization.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">3. What We Do NOT Collect</h2>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Name, email, or phone number (unless you voluntarily contact us)</li>
        <li>Payment information</li>
        <li>Precise geolocation</li>
        <li>Browsing history outside Vyxqor</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use cookies for:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li><strong>Necessary:</strong> Website functionality and cookie consent storage</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics 4 (anonymized IP, limited retention)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> CDN, DDoS protection, and hosting</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4:</strong> Traffic analysis (anonymized)</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate networks:</strong> Impact, PartnerStack (for commission tracking only)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Analytics data is retained for 14 months. Affiliate click data is retained for as long as required by our partner agreements (typically 12–24 months). You can request deletion of any data associated with you by contacting us.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under GDPR, CCPA, and applicable privacy laws, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Know what data we collect about you</li>
        <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Opt out of analytics tracking</li>
        <li>Withdraw cookie consent at any time</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">To exercise these rights, email: privacy@vyxqor.com</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at: <a href="mailto:privacy@vyxqor.com" style="color: var(--accent);">privacy@vyxqor.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>